<title>AUSTRALIA: Peptide in talks on London listing.</title>
<headline>Peptide in talks on London listing.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drug development group Peptide Technology Ltd said on Thursday it was continuing talks that would enable it to appoint a sponsor and broker who would advise on its proposed listing on the London stock exchange.</p>
<p>In September, Peptide postponed the secondary listing of its shares in London, citing poor market conditions.</p>
<p>Peptide shares closed three cents down at 53 cents.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
